<title>USA: Omaha cattle off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were $0.50 to $1.00 lower, heifers off most.</p>
<p>Steers - select to largely choice 2-4 1100-1350 lbs 66.00-67.50. Select 60.00-65.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to mostly choice 2-4 975-1250 lbs 65.00-67.50. Select 60.00-65.00.</p>
</text>
